sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Operator
  participant S as Studio
  participant A as Artifacts
  participant R as Qualified runtime
  participant V as Trusted verifier
  participant D as Delivery
  O->>S: Approve task revision and selected context
  S->>A: Freeze records and packet; confirm source
  S->>R: Map custody and approved base
  R->>A: Publish per-agent contribution
  S->>A: Build isolated candidate
  S->>V: Check final candidate SHA
  V->>A: Write trusted verification receipt
  S->>O: Present candidate and evidence
  O->>S: Record review decision
  opt Separately authorized integration
    S->>D: Candidate and expected destination base
    D->>D: Compare-and-swap, then read back
    D->>A: Confirmed or outcome-unknown receipt
  end
